OL,3,ARussia hits second major bridge in
OL,4,AUkraine's capital Kyiv
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Russian strike has hit a second major
OL,7,Fbridge in Kyiv, Mayor Vitaliy Klitschko
OL,8,Fhas said, as Moscow ramps up attacks on
OL,9,Fcritical infrastructure in Ukraine's
OL,10,Fcapital.
OL,12,FThe attack on Saturday morning injured
OL,13,Ftwo people, and damaged the road
OL,14,Fsurface and overhead trolleybus wires
OL,15,Fon the Pivnichnyi (Northern) Bridge,
OL,16,FKlitschko said, causing traffic jams.
OL,18,FIt comes after the Pivdennyi (Southern)
OL,19,FBridge was hit multiple times by
OL,20,FRussian drones this week, with
OL,21,FKlitschko warning that "the enemy is
OL,22,Ftearing Kyiv apart".
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
