OL,3,AG7 to release millions of barrels of
OL,4,Aoil and diesel after Trump threat
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnder the measures, which come after US
OL,7,FPresident Donald Trump had threatened
OL,8,Fto ban diesel exports, there will not
OL,9,Fbe any "export restrictions on energy
OL,10,Fand energy products" between G7
OL,11,Fmembers.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
